<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Radiokomunikace 1996 net profit up.</title>
<headline>Czech Radiokomunikace 1996 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary unaudited results for year ending December 31, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Net profit		160.59    vs	137.46</p>
<p> Gross profit	    160.59    vs	205.74</p>
<p> Income tax		  0.00    vs	 68.28</p>
